any change, you run it against a frozen set of examples, so you can see whether behavior held

33
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:25,000
or slipped. Notice the through line. A deployed app is never truly static, because the platform

34
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:31,000
keeps evolving underneath it. Plan for this work up front, and it becomes routine instead of an

35
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:38,000
emergency. Model migration goes smoother once you understand how model IDs actually work. So,

